25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397167\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>Sismo a 53 km al SE de Coalcom\\u00e1n, Michoac\\u00e1n, M\\u00e9xico</b>\\n</li><li>Hora Local: 04:56:05 25/10/2026\\n</li><li>Latitud: 18.319\\u00b0\\n</li><li>Longitud: -103.017\\u00b0\\n</li><li>Profundidad: 12.7 km\\n</li><li>Magnitud: 3.4\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n<p> </p>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:34-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:34-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397163\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397163\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfPor qu\\u00e9 se reportan varias magnitudes para un mismo sismo?\\u00a0\\u00a0</b>\\n</li><li>Porque la primera informaci\\u00f3n proviene de estaciones cercanas y se ajusta conforme m\\u00e1s datos llegan de diferentes sensores. La ciencia sigue calculando despu\\u00e9s del primer aviso.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:03-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T10:02:03-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397157\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397157\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfC\\u00f3mo se sabe que va a temblar?</b>\\n</li><li>Los sismos no se pueden predecir, pero los sism\\u00f3grafos y aceler\\u00f3grafos detectan los movimientos del suelo en tiempo real para alertarnos lo m\\u00e1s r\\u00e1pido posible.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n<p> </p>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:40-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:40-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397145\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397145\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfCU\\u00c1L ES EL SISMO DE MAYOR MAGNITUD QUE SACUDI\\u00d3 LA CIUDAD DE M\\u00c9XICO?</b>\\n</li><li>El 19 de septiembre de 1985, la ciudad de M\\u00e9xico experiment\\u00f3 un devastador terremoto de 8.1 en la escala de magnitud, con su epicentro en la costa del Pac\\u00edfico.\\u00a0\\n</li><li>Se estima que al menos 10,000 personas perdieron la vida, afectando y derribando miles de estructuras de vivienda, comercio y de servicios p\\u00fablicos.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:29-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:29-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397144\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397144\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfQU\\u00c9 ES UN SISMO?</b>\\n</li><li>Un sismo es un rompimiento repentino de las rocas en el interior de la Tierra. Esta liberaci\\u00f3n repentina de energ\\u00eda se propaga en forma de ondas que provocan el movimiento del terreno.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:19-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:19-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397143\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397143\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfCU\\u00c1NTO DURA UN SISMO Y POR QU\\u00c9 EL SSN NO REPORTA ESTE DATO?</b>\\n</li><li>Cuando hablamos de duraci\\u00f3n de un sismo nos podemos referir a varios conceptos diferentes: Una es la duraci\\u00f3n del movimiento percibida por el ser humano, otra la duraci\\u00f3n del registro instrumental (puede ser incluso de varios minutos) y otro es el tiempo que dur\\u00f3 el movimiento de la falla que origin\\u00f3 el sismo (que puede ser de unos cuantos segundos).\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:06-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:42:06-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397142\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397142\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfCU\\u00c1L ES LA DIFERENCIA ENTRE LA MAGNITUD Y LA INTENSIDAD DE UN SISMO?</b>\\n</li><li>Son escalas para medir el tama\\u00f1o o el impacto de un temblor. La escala de magnitud se obtiene de forma num\\u00e9rica a partir de registros obtenidos por sism\\u00f3grafos y est\\u00e1 relacionada con el tama\\u00f1o y la energ\\u00eda liberada durante un temblor. La escala de intensidad se asigna en funci\\u00f3n a los da\\u00f1os o efectos causados al hombre y sus construcciones.y oeste, con las placas de Cocos, Rivera y del Pac\\u00edfico.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:41:51-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:41:51-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397141\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397141\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><b>\\u00bfPOR QU\\u00c9 OCURREN TANTOS SISMOS EN M\\u00c9XICO?</b>\\n</li><li>En el contexto de la Tect\\u00f3nica de Placas, M\\u00e9xico est\\u00e1 ubicado en el llamado Cintur\\u00f3n de Fuego, donde se registran gran parte de los movimientos tel\\u00faricos a nivel mundial. El pa\\u00eds se ubica en la Placa Norteamericana, limitado en su porci\\u00f3n sur y oeste, con las placas de Cocos, Rivera y del Pac\\u00edfico.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:41:40-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:41:40-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397140\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397140\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li>M\\u00e9xico es uno de los pa\\u00edses del mundo con mayor actividad tel\\u00farica, ya que seg\\u00fan estad\\u00edsticas, se registran m\\u00e1s de 90 sismos por a\\u00f1o con magnitud superior a 4 grados en la escala de Richter, lo que equivale a un 60% de todos los movimientos tel\\u00faricos que se registran en el mundo.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": \"Temblor en M\\u00e9xico hoy, domingo 25 de octubre: epicentro y magnitud seg\\u00fan reporte SSN\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-25T09:41:25-0500\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-25T09:41:25-0500\", \"alternateName\": \"Revisa aqu\\u00ed la \\u00faltima hora de la actividad s\\u00edsmica en M\\u00e9xico reportada por el Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (SSN).\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"\"}, \"@id\": \"#liveblog-397139\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"#author\", \"name\": \"Redacci\\u00f3n EC\", \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/autor/redaccion-ec/\"}], \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"#organization\"}, \"url\": \"https://elcomercio.pe/respuestas/mexico/temblor-en-mexico-hoy-en-vivo-ultimo-sismo-25-y-26-de-octubre-2026-registrado-por-el-ssn-cual-fue-la-magnitud-epicentro-y-hora-servicio-sismologico-nacional-mexico-cdmx-mx-lbposting-noticia/#liveblog-397139\", \"articleBody\": \"\\t<ul class='story-contents__paragraph-list'>\\n<li><a href=https://elcomercio.pe/noticias/temblor-en-mexico/>\\u00bfDe qu\\u00e9 magnitud y en d\\u00f3nde fue el \\u00faltimo temblor en M\\u00e9xico?</a>\\n Mira aqu\\u00ed en vivo los reportes del Servicio Sismol\\u00f3gico Nacional (\\n<a href=https://elcomercio.pe/noticias/ssn/>SSN</a>\\n) sobre los sismos en el pa\\u00eds.\\n</li></ul>\\n\\n\", \"image\": [{\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=675&width=1200\", \"height\": \"675\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=900&width=1200\", \"height\": \"900\", \"width\": \"1200\"}, {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"/resizer/v2/XQQ54H45MJDX7JHD4XW243IDYA.webp?auth=8bdaf8abe80e60fccede1b150ec011c219064a58d01874a49e3a1fed558d619a?height=1200&width=1200\", \"height\": \"1200\", \"width\": \"1200\"}]}]}], \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\"}<\/script>:"},{"_id":"GCTDQHRP2VAQ5JP5CTJM4JOFPQ","type":"text","content":""}],"subheadlines":{"basic":"Revisa aquí la última hora de la actividad sísmica en México reportada por el Servicio Sismológico Nacional (SSN)."},"description":{"basic":"Temblor en México EN VIVO: cuál fue el epicentro y magnitud del último evento sísmico reportado HOY por el Servicio Sismológico Nacional (SSN)."},"language":"","source":{"system":"composer","name":"elcomercio","source_type":"staff"},"taxonomy":{"primary_site":{"path":"/respuestas/mexico","parent_id":"/respuestas","name":"Mexico","description":null,"_id":"/respuestas/mexico","additional_properties":{"original":{"parent":{"header-pro":null,"default":"/respuestas","menu-pro":"/respuestas"},"site":{"pagebuilder_path_for_native_apps":null,"site_url":null,"site_keywords":null,"site_about":null,"site_description":null,"site_title":null,"site_tagline":null},"navigation":{"nav_title":null},"_admin":{"alias_ids":["/respuestas/mexico"]},"inactive":false,"node_type":"section","social":{"twitter":null,"rss":null,"facebook":null,"instagram":null},"site_topper":{"site_logo_image":null},"name":"Mexico","_id":"/respuestas/mexico","ancestors":{"header-pro":[],"default":["/respuestas"],"menu-pro":["/respuestas"]},"order":{"menu-pro":2008}}},"type":"site","version":"0.5.8"},"sites":[{"path":"/respuestas/mexico","parent_id":"/respuestas","name":"Mexico","description":null,"_id":"/respuestas/mexico","additional_properties":{"