XDCYNLNC5FLGSZMS6LWABNI","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<b>Real Madrid venció 2-1 al FC Barcelona</b> en el estadio Camp Nou por LaLiga, arrebatándole el invicto al conjunto azulgrana en un vibrante Clásico español. Tras un primer tiempo con llegadas en ambos lados, Kylian Mbappé abrió el marcador al minuto 41 tras cazar un rebote en el área. En la segunda mitad, el Barcelona reaccionó y consiguió la igualdad al minuto 61 con un certero cabezazo de Raphinha a pase de Pedri. Sin embargo, cuando el dominio local parecía inclinar la balanza, una brillante jugada de Eduardo Camavinga asistió a Mbappé para firmar su doblete definitivo al minuto 88."},{"_id":"THEAYE7G3JBWTD2Z5GYZBR46A4","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<b>¿A qué hora juega Barcelona vs. Real Madrid por El Clásico de LaLiga? </b>Revisa los horarios de El Clásico de España."},{"owner":{"sponsored":false,"id":"elcomercio"},"address":{},"syndication":{"search":false,"external_distribution":false},"auth":{"1":"5540511a279dd84767b96eb47e2961c72ac1f861404773a8d9b90048bfc56b08"},"caption":"Horarios de El Clásico, Barcelona vs. Real Madrid hoy, domingo 25 de octubre por la jornada 10 de LaLiga desde el estadio Camp Nou.","source":{"system":"photo center","edit_url":"","additional_properties":{"editor":"photo center"}},"taxonomy":{"associated_tasks":[]},"type":"image","version":"0.10.9","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/VWLSLUOVCRDMNCPI42C6P23LWM.jpg","licensable":false,"planning":{},"credits":{"affiliation":[]},"subtitle":"Horarios de El Clásico, Barcelona vs. Real Madrid hoy, domingo 25 de octubre por la jornada 10 de LaLiga desde el estadio Camp Nou.","width":1600,"_id":"VWLSLUOVCRDMNCPI42C6P23LWM","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/VWLSLUOVCRDMNCPI42C6P23LWM.jpg?auth=5540511a279dd84767b96eb47e2961c72ac1f861404773a8d9b90048bfc56b08","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/VWLSLUOVCRDMNCPI42C6P23LWM.jpg?auth=5540511a279dd84767b96eb47e2961c72ac1f861404773a8d9b90048bfc56b08","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/elcomercio/VWLSLUOVCRDMNCPI42C6P23LWM.jpg","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/VWLSLUOVCRDMNCPI42C6P23LWM.jpg?auth=5540511a279dd84767b96eb47e2961c72ac1f861404773a8d9b90048bfc56b08","ingestionMethod":"manual","thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/VWLSLUOVCRDMNCPI42C6P23LWM.jpg?auth=5540511a279dd84767b96eb47e2961c72ac1f861404773a8d9b90048bfc56b08&width=300","version":0,"originalName":"PERÚ vs nigeria (46).jpg","mime_type":"image/jpeg","restricted":false,"template_id":302,"galleries":[]},"created_date":"2026-10-24T01:00:30Z","last_updated_date":"2026-10-24T01:00:30Z","height":900,"image_type":"photograph","status":""},{"level":3,"_id":"5AL7D5U66VFOBCSZ5B5UPQXD24","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<b>¿A qué hora juega Barcelona vs. Real Madrid por LaLiga?</b>"},{"_id":"MXCTHKCTZVDNNDU72AUMNX2GOM","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"El partido de <b>Barcelona vs. Real Madrid</b> por la fecha 10 de LaLiga empieza a las 3:00 PM de Perú y 10:00 PM de España este domingo 25 de octubre del 2026 en el estadio Camp Nou."},{"list_type":"unordered","_id":"3GZDAD3DW5GKHIQNYTFNC5ELLQ","type":"list","items":[{"_id":"BWRZEKIB3FELRMWVH22IGDV3HU","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en México, Guatemala, Honduras, Costa Rica: 2:00 PM"},{"_id":"VXWF4BFSVFACLD2YGZBRHIKGQI","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en Perú, Colombia y Ecuador: 3:00 PM"},{"_id":"QJYQCKHBYNGQZEV6PLHTWHEA5Y","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en Bolivia, Venezuela, Estados Unidos: 4:00 PM"},{"_id":"KBG7BZJROBFGTHU26UMEDPR7DU","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en Argentina, Brasil, Uruguay, Paraguay, Chile: 5:00 PM"},{"_id":"UKB5FQCEV5HUPCCDMFQQHHEHGY","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"Hora en España: 10:00 PM "}]},{"level":3,"_id":"LROO7EXRUJE6JP2A2664FVKGYA","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<b>¿En qué canal TV ver Barcelona vs. Real Madrid por LaLiga?</b>"},{"_id":"SNPYRBX34FCHJGCQJ6WHFTV7ZE","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"El Clásico entre <b>Barcelona vs. Real Madrid</b> será transmitido a través de DirecTV y DGO en Perú y resto de Sudamérica. Mientras que en España lo televisa DAZN y Movistar Plus+. "},{"_id":"RB2YZMGQ6JE5HCQRJ2LXWXN55E","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Por otro lado, en México, El Clásico será transmitido a través de izzi y Sky Sports. Y finalmente, En Estados Unidos, la transmisión de el clásico va a través de ESPN+, ESPN Deportes y ABC."},{"level":3,"_id":"VIB6LG2VANHAJHK5JYF22VIRBM","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<b>Hora y canal TV para ver Barcelona vs. Real Madrid por LaLiga</b>"},{"list_type":"unordered","_id":"STI7IS7GONETDMIBSFVXLTLEVM","type":"list","items":[{"_id":"BOJJ5AFHQJBBNLTPHWIB6PMAOM","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<b>Fecha:</b> Sábado 12 de septiembre del 2026."},{"_id":"C6Z2JMBJTBAMLLYLRSIASINMK4","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<b>Partido: </b>Alianza Lima vs. Universitario"},{"_id":"CONOZD4RPRHXDIJFVOGWPAUVJ4","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<b>Horario:</b> 8:00 PM hora de Perú."},{"_id":"DRLJDSGQTBBCNMNO2YNJJSO62M","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<b>Canal:</b> Liga 1 MAX."},{"_id":"VD7AGRMNJNHB7AB6T7PZQHOBTM","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<b>Estadio:</b> Alejandro Villanueva "}]},{"subtype":"custom-ec-blocks","_id":"6DXFW3JNVBHZRBDN52HRKDFFWY","embed":{"id":"no-fetch","config":{"data":{"date":1792803476,"conversi